WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.234
Narrator: A LOT HAPPENS

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:04.434
WHEN AN INFLATED RUBBER BALL
HITS THE GROUND.

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.801
THE RUBBER COMPRESSES
AND QUICKLY SNAPS

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:08.767
BACK TO ITS ROUND SHAPE.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:12.133
THAT SNAPPING BACK
MAKES THE BALL BOUNCE.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.634
IN ADDITION, THE AIR
INSIDE THE BALL ACTS

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:19.901
AS A TIGHTLY COILED SPRING,
INCREASING THE REBOUND.

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:21.701
♪♪

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.567
WHEN AN INFLATED RUBBER BALL
FALLS TO THE GROUND,

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:25.801
IT BOUNCES BACK,

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:28.300
AND PLAYERS CATCH IT
ON THE REBOUND.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.167
THIS TYPE OF BALL IS
AT THE HEART OF MANY GAMES,

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:35.033
FROM BASKETBALL
TO SOCCER TO VOLLEYBALL.

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:38.834
AT THE CORE IS AN INFLATED
RUBBER BLADDER.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:42.000
MAKING IT STARTS WITH A SHEET
OF NATURAL RUBBER.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.534
THE FACTORY WORKER FOLDS IT
IN A SPECIFIC CONFIGURATION.

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:50.300
HE PLACES A DIE ON TOP
AND ACTIVATES A PRESS

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.934
TO FORCE IT THROUGH THE LAYERS,
WHICH CUTS OUT THE SHAPE.

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:57.801
HE NOW HAS THE BLADDER
OF A SPORTS BALL.

00:00:57.801 --> 00:01:00.734
HE BRUSHES AN ADHESIVE
AROUND THE HOLE IN THE BLADDER

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.400
AND INSERTS A PLUG.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:07.801
♪♪

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.234
ANOTHER WORKER INFLATES
THE RUBBER BLADDER

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:13.267
AS SHE PLACES IT
IN A SPHERICAL CHAMBER.

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:16.033
IT HEATS AND CURES
THE RUBBER FOR 5 MINUTES

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:19.767
AT A TEMPERATURE OF
284 DEGREES FAHRENHEIT.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:22.734
THE RUBBER BLADDER SPINS
ON A REVOLVING CYLINDER,

00:01:22.734 --> 00:01:25.734
CAUSING IT TO TAKE UP
NYLON THREADS.

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:28.634
THE THREADS TWIST AROUND
THE BLADDER AND FORM A LAYER

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:32.601
THAT BOTH STRENGTHENS IT
AND KEEPS IT ROUND.

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:35.400
THE MATERIAL THAT WILL FORM
THE EXTERIOR OF THE BALL

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.033
IS MADE USING COLORED SYNTHETIC
RUBBER, NATURAL RUBBER,

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.934
MAGNESIUM CARBONATE,
AND MINERAL OIL.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:45.701
ONCE IT CURES, A WORKER
ROLLS IT INTO THICK SHEETS

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:48.300
AND SLICES IT
TO A SPECIFIC WIDTH.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.934
HE FOLDS IT SEVERAL TIMES.

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:54.868
THIS BLUE RUBBER WILL BE USED
FOR VOLLEYBALLS.

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:58.701
THE FOLDED RUBBER NOW TRAVELS
BETWEEN A SERIES OF ROLLERS.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:01.701
THEY FLATTEN IT AND PRESS
IT EXTREMELY THIN,

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:04.234
AND IT BECOMES BOTH
LIGHTWEIGHT AND FORMABLE.

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:06.901
♪♪

00:02:06.901 --> 00:02:11.801
AN AUTOMATED BLADE SLICES
THE RUBBER INTO SHORTER PIECES.

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:14.000
A METAL PATTERN CUTTER
WILL NOW BE USED

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
TO CUT THE RUBBER INTO STRIPS,

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.133
WHICH WILL FIT TOGETHER
TO FORM THE OUTSIDE OF THE BALL.

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:23.334
THESE PARTICULAR STRIPS
ARE FOR A BASKETBALL.

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:27.767
THE WORKER PLACES THE PATTERN
ON SEVERAL PIECES OF RUBBER.

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:31.434
A PRESS FORCES THE SHARP-EDGED
PATTERN THROUGH THE RUBBER

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:33.534
TO CUT OUT FISH-SHAPED STRIPS

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:36.234
THAT ARE DESIGNED TO FIT
AROUND THE ROUND BLADDER.

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:39.934
♪♪

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:44.767
SHE LINES THE TWO HALVES OF A
BONDING SHAPER WITH THE STRIPS.

00:02:44.767 --> 00:02:49.834
♪♪

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.200
SHE INSERTS THE BLADDER

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.834
AND RE-INFLATES IT.

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:56.767
♪♪

00:02:56.767 --> 00:03:00.300
SHE CLOSES THE BONDING
CHAMBER AND ACTIVATES IT.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.267
INSIDE, HEAT AND PRESSURE
CAUSE THE STRIPS

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:06.734
TO STICK TO THE BLADDER.

00:03:06.734 --> 00:03:10.234
TO MAKE A MEDICINE BALL,
WHICH IS USED FOR EXERCISING,

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:13.801
A DIFFERENT PATTERN CUTTER
IS USED.

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:16.100
THE FORMING PROCESS IS THE SAME,

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.000
BUT THIS BALL HAS A UNIQUE
VISUAL IMPACT

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.667
VERY DIFFERENT
FROM THAT OF THE BASKETBALL.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:25.367
♪♪

00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:27.200
BACK AT THE BASKETBALL STATION,

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:32.067
A WORKER APPLIES THE BRAND NAME
TO THE OUTER SKIN IN TWO PLACES.

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:35.834
GLUE HELPS THE DECAL
STICK TO THE RUBBER.

00:03:35.834 --> 00:03:39.501
THIS MOLD WILL NOW TRANSFER
A PATTERN ONTO THE RUBBER BALL

00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:42.968
WHILE ALSO BAKING
THE LETTERING INTO IT.

00:03:42.968 --> 00:03:46.834
ANOTHER WORKER PLACES THE BALL
IN THE MOLD AND PUMPS MORE AIR

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:48.734
INTO THE BLADDER.

00:03:48.734 --> 00:03:50.534
HE CLOSES THE LID.

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:52.367
THE MOLD APPLIES HEAT
AND PRESSURE

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:56.767
TO EMBOSS THE PATTERN
ONTO THE RUBBER.

00:03:56.767 --> 00:03:59.501
THE LETTERING HAS
PENETRATED THE RUBBER,

00:03:59.501 --> 00:04:03.067
AND THE WORKER PEELS
OFF THE DECAL PLASTIC.

00:04:03.067 --> 00:04:06.100
ANOTHER WORKER REPLENISHES
THE AIR THAT'S BEEN LOST

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.701
TO MAKE THE BALL
COMPLETELY FULL AND ROUND.

00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:13.100
THE BALL IS NOW READY
TO RECEIVE ITS STRIPES.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.601
THE WORKER PAINTS BLACK RUBBER
INTO GROOVES

00:04:15.601 --> 00:04:18.167
THAT WERE FORMED
DURING EMBOSSING.

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:22.634
THIS RUBBER QUICKLY CURES
TO BECOME PART OF THE BALL.

00:04:22.634 --> 00:04:26.100
ANOTHER WORKER INSERTS
A FILL VALVE INTO THE HOLE.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:30.033
THEN MECHANICAL FISTS
SQUEEZE THE BALL TO DEFLATE IT.

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:32.400
THIS PREPARES IT FOR PACKAGING.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.634
WITH THE VALVE INSIDE,
IT CAN BE EASILY RE-INFLATED

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:39.000
BY THE CUSTOMER.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.767
A WORKER WRAPS IT IN PLASTIC
AND SHIPS IT TO THE RETAILER.

00:04:44.901 --> 00:04:47.400
MAKING THIS RUBBER BASKETBALL
HAS ONLY TAKEN

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.834
A COUPLE OF HOURS,

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:51.267
BUT IT SHOULD BE ABLE
TO TAKE A LOT OF KNOCKS

00:04:51.267 --> 00:04:53.133
AND BOUNCE RIGHT BACK.

